{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，三星電子與SK海力士正競爭性下單採購極紫外（EUV）光刻機，兩家的投入規模均在10萬億至20萬億韓元區間。阿斯麥（ASML）已明確2027–2028年EUV設備供給缺口，能否鎖定交付排期，成為兩家擴產先進DRAM的核心。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585614.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.793509+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:20:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_hash":"f9de06051da41bf3ca183a11b3f8eb9496684db1c1397c5e4f2c84d5a151d797","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}